# React Native Best Practices for F1-APP-ST

## Component Architecture

### **Component Types**
- **Legacy Components**: Existing Class components (don't modify unless necessary)
- **New Components**: Always use Functional components with hooks
- **Container Components**: Store in `/src/containers/` for screens and major features
- **Reusable Components**: Store in `/src/components/` for shared UI elements

### **Functional Component Pattern**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Functional component with hooks
import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { View, Text, TouchableOpacity } from 'react-native';

const UserProfile = ({ navigation, route }) => {
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);
  const [userData, setUserData] = useState(null);

  useEffect(() => {
    // 載入用戶資料
    loadUserData();
  }, []);

  const loadUserData = async () => {
    setLoading(true);
    try {
      const data = await Api.getUserProfile();
      setUserData(data);
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Failed to load user data:', error);
    } finally {
      setLoading(false);
    }
  };

  return (
    <View>
      {loading ? (
        <Text>載入中...</Text>
      ) : (
        <Text>{userData?.name}</Text>
      )}
    </View>
  );
};

export default UserProfile;
```

### **Class Component Pattern (Legacy)**
```javascript
// ✅ Acceptable - Keep existing class components as-is
import React, { Component } from 'react';
import { View, Text } from 'react-native';

class LegacyComponent extends Component {
  constructor(props) {
    super(props);
    this.state = {
      loading: false,
      data: null
    };
  }

  componentDidMount() {
    this.loadData();
  }

  // Keep existing patterns unchanged
  render() {
    return (
      <View>
        {/* Existing component logic */}
      </View>
    );
  }
}

export default LegacyComponent;
```

## State Management

### **Local State with useState**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Use useState for local component state
const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);
const [formData, setFormData] = useState({
  username: '',
  password: ''
});

// Handle form updates
const updateFormData = (field, value) => {
  setFormData(prev => ({
    ...prev,
    [field]: value
  }));
};
```

### **Global State with Redux**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Connect to Redux store
import { connect } from 'react-redux';
import { bindActionCreators } from 'redux';
import { loginUser, logoutUser } from '../actions/UserActions';

const UserScreen = ({ user, loginUser, logoutUser }) => {
  // Component logic
};

const mapStateToProps = (state) => ({
  user: state.user,
  isAuthenticated: state.auth.isAuthenticated
});

const mapDispatchToProps = (dispatch) => 
  bindActionCreators({ loginUser, logoutUser }, dispatch);

export default connect(mapStateToProps, mapDispatchToProps)(UserScreen);
```

## Navigation Patterns

### **React Navigation 6 Pattern**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Use React Navigation 6 for new screens
import { useNavigation, useRoute } from '@react-navigation/native';

const NewScreen = () => {
  const navigation = useNavigation();
  const route = useRoute();

  const handleNavigate = () => {
    navigation.navigate('TargetScreen', {
      userId: route.params?.userId
    });
  };

  return (
    <TouchableOpacity onPress={handleNavigate}>
      <Text>前往下一頁</Text>
    </TouchableOpacity>
  );
};
```

### **Legacy Navigation Pattern**
```javascript
// ✅ Acceptable - Keep existing navigation patterns
import { Actions } from 'react-native-router-flux';

const handleLegacyNavigation = () => {
  Actions.push('targetScene', { userId: 123 });
};
```

## Performance Optimization

### **Image Optimization**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Use FastImage for better performance
import FastImage from 'react-native-fast-image';

const UserAvatar = ({ imageUrl }) => (
  <FastImage
    style={{ width: 50, height: 50 }}
    source={{
      uri: imageUrl,
      priority: FastImage.priority.normal,
    }}
    resizeMode={FastImage.resizeMode.cover}
  />
);
```

### **List Performance**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Use FlatList with optimization
import { FlatList } from 'react-native';

const GameList = ({ games }) => {
  const renderGame = ({ item }) => (
    <GameItem game={item} />
  );

  return (
    <FlatList
      data={games}
      renderItem={renderGame}
      keyExtractor={item => item.id.toString()}
      getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({
        length: 80,
        offset: 80 * index,
        index,
      })}
      removeClippedSubviews={true}
      maxToRenderPerBatch={10}
      windowSize={10}
    />
  );
};
```

## API Integration

### **API Call Pattern**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Use consistent API pattern
import { Api } from '../actions/Api';

const fetchUserBets = async () => {
  try {
    setLoading(true);
    const response = await Api.getUserBets({
      userId: currentUser.id,
      page: 1,
      limit: 20
    });
    
    if (response.success) {
      setBets(response.data);
    } else {
      showError('FETCH_BETS_FAILED');
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('API Error:', error);
    showError('NETWORK_ERROR');
  } finally {
    setLoading(false);
  }
};
```

### **Error Handling**
```javascript
// ✅ Good - Consistent error handling
const showError = (errorKey) => {
  const errorMessage = strings[errorKey] || strings.UNKNOWN_ERROR;
  Alert.alert(strings.ERROR_TITLE, errorMessage);
};
```

